Timothée,

Based upon previous examples I think you just need to add the following to your code:

+ labs(colour = "legend title")

So...

gplot(cin,aes(x=t)) +
geom_line(aes(y=re,colour='Enemy richness')) +
geom_line(aes(y=rv,colour='Victim richness')) +

facet_grid(Ar~Ur) +
labs(colour = "legend title")

Never seen an example with a facet though so give it a go and report back.

Brandon

