Hi:

Probably the easiest thing to do would be to reorder the column locations in the original data frame before you melt it, something like

mydata <- mydata[, c(2, 3, 1, 4, 8, 5, 7, 6)]

One line - no muss, no fuss :)

HTH,
Dennis

