Well, answered my own question regarding a workaround. Changing:

p+geom_smooth(size=2,alpha=0.1)

to

p+geom_smooth(size=2,alpha=0.1)+geom_smooth(data=subset(d,
FALSE),size=2,se=FALSE,alpha=1)

seems to do what I expect.

