Deear Felipe,

This is more a general R-help question than a ggplot2 question...

The week column 'disappears' in your apply code because to tell it to disappear. Have a look at str(winter[, 2:7])

You just need to cbind week to the result of apply()

cbind(winter[, 1, drop = FALSE], apply(winter[,-1], 2, cumsum))

Another option

cumsumwinter <- winter
cumsumwinter[, -1] <- apply(cumsumwinter[, -1], 2, cumsum)

Best regards,

Thierry

